
Audit Control Environment(ACE), Audit Manager 
http://adapt.umiacs.umd.edu/ace

Please see the INSTALL file for new ace installation instructions. Otherwise,
for upgrades, look at the UPGRADE file. 

Release notes are available at 
https://scm.umiacs.umd.edu/redmine/adapt/projects/ace/roadmap

Issue Tracker and releases:
https://scm.umiacs.umd.edu/redmine/adapt/projects/ace

Documentation:
http://adapt.umiacs.umd.edu/ace

Help, discussion:
http://groups.google.com/group/ace-devel

Build
- apt install openjdk-8-jdk-headless
- update-alternatives --config java
- git clone git@github.com:Chronopolis-Digital-Preservation/audit-control-environment.git
- cd audit-control-environment
- ./mvnw package

WAR in ace-am/target/ace-am-1.15.0-RELEASE.war

RELEASE in ace-dist/target/ace-dist-1.15.0-RELEASE-bin.tar.gz
